From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:19:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Wi-Fi dialogs, avatar crop and printer driver as pages

Plinius: the last windows of their own in Settings that a phone meets
open as pages of the window, with the back arrow and the back swipe:

- Wi-Fi: connect to a hidden network, create a network and the 802.1X
  dialog (libnma's NMAWifiDialog, a GtkDialog) and the avatar crop go
  through cc_plinius_gtk_dialog_present_as_page() (shell/
  cc-plinius-dialog-pages.c): the content moves into a page, the
  confirming button ("Connect", "Create", "Select") to its header bar,
  back answers "Cancel". The function is declared weak, so that
  programs linking these files without the shell still link.
- Printers: the driver selection was an AdwWindow; now an AdwDialog
  without "Cancel". Back, the back swipe and Escape answer Cancel
  ("closed"), an answer is given only once, as its page may also go
  with the "Add Printer" page below it.

Left as windows: the mouse test and the tablet and color calibration
(full-screen tools) and the tablet's button mapping (only for tablets
with buttons).
---
 panels/network/network-dialogs.c            | 11 ++++++++
 panels/printers/pp-details-dialog.c         |  9 +++----
 panels/printers/pp-new-printer-dialog.c     | 14 +++-------
 panels/printers/pp-ppd-selection-dialog.blp | 23 +++++-----------
 panels/printers/pp-ppd-selection-dialog.c   | 30 +++++++++------------
 panels/printers/pp-ppd-selection-dialog.h   |  2 +-
 panels/system/users/cc-avatar-chooser.c     | 12 +++++++++
 7 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)

diff --git a/panels/network/network-dialogs.c b/panels/network/network-dialogs.c
index 06d4e26..6c72d34 100644
--- a/panels/network/network-dialogs.c
+++ b/panels/network/network-dialogs.c
@@ -155,6 +155,10 @@ done:
     gtk_window_destroy (GTK_WINDOW (dialog));
 }
 
+/* Plinius: shell/cc-plinius-dialog-pages.c shows a GtkDialog as a page of the window; weak, so
+ * that programs linking this file without the shell (tests) still link */
+extern gboolean cc_plinius_gtk_dialog_present_as_page (GtkDialog *dialog, GtkWidget *parent) __attribute__ ((weak));
+
 static void
 show_wireless_dialog (GtkWidget *toplevel, NMClient *client, GtkWidget *dialog)
 {
@@ -170,6 +174,13 @@ show_wireless_dialog (GtkWidget *toplevel, NMClient *client, GtkWidget *dialog)
     g_signal_connect_data (dialog, "response", G_CALLBACK (wireless_dialog_response_cb), closure,
                            wireless_dialog_closure_closure_notify, 0);
 
+    /* Plinius: a page of the window with the back swipe, not a window of its own */
+    G_GNUC_BEGIN_IGNORE_DEPRECATIONS
+    if (cc_plinius_gtk_dialog_present_as_page &&
+        cc_plinius_gtk_dialog_present_as_page (GTK_DIALOG (dialog), toplevel))
+        return;
+    G_GNUC_END_IGNORE_DEPRECATIONS
+
     g_object_bind_property (G_OBJECT (toplevel), "visible", G_OBJECT (dialog), "visible", G_BINDING_SYNC_CREATE);
 }
 
